You can use his habit of summoning nasty monsters against him. 
Cockatrices are among the monsters that can be summoned by Rodney. 
Kill the cockatrices first, pick up a corpse and use it (assuming you
are wearing gloves).  Rodney is not stoning resistant, nor are any
liches, minotaur, jabberwocks, titans, vampires or any dragon other
than yellow.  Just make sure you don't fall in a pit or through a hole
while wielding a cockatrice corpse.

